OneiOS, stack 555b13d (NativeMetal 935c468), patches-555b13d/NativeMetal/0004: patches/NativeMetal/0006 (take18) unchanged
(it applies to 935c468 as it is; cargo check of the bridge on 555b13d: see docs/gpu.md 7.2).
